                "prompt": "The request is on hold for the customer's protection (reason {{reason}}). If the reason above is a placeholder in braces, decide from the conversation which case fits. In two or three short sentences in the caller's language, without blaming them:\n- If the reason is S_COACHING, or the request was to move money to a \"safe\" or \"verification\" account: explain kindly that Aero Bank never asks customers to move money to such an account and no genuine official asks for this on a call, for example: \"Aero Bank कभी भी पैसे किसी safe account में भेजने को नहीं कहता। आपकी सुरक्षा के लिए यह request अभी hold पर है।\"\n- If the reason is T_DISTRESS or the caller is grieving or upset: say you are sorry and that a specialist will help them personally.\n- Otherwise: say this request needs a specialist.\nThen offer to connect a specialist now: \"क्या मैं आपको अभी एक specialist से जोड़ दूँ?\"",
